{
  "name": "ondra-adb",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的手机短信只读通道：按手册 §9.11 的端侧实证只做 `content://sms/inbox` 未读轮询（每 15 秒、单轮 20 条、已答集合 1000 裁到 500），不做截图、点击与中文输入，也不发短信——回复靠 `replyWebhook` + 用户自备 Intent 桥。只读不是文档承诺，是 `policy.ts` 里一道结构白名单：除那一条 `content query` 之外一律拒绝，连会被设备侧 sh 重解析的 `; | $` 也拒绝。命令执行与回复投递都是端口，定时器挂在 ctx.effect 的 disposer 上，卸载即停。默认关闭。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
